{"unit_id":"Zci514__dsh-nightwatch#card-zh","repo":"Zci514/dsh-nightwatch","commit":"0d76a4173140612ebe370ecf78d544ea64f7860d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-nightwatch 是一款面向 DSH 网页会话的守夜插件：在输入框工具栏加入按钮，可选择快捷时长或填写截止时间。启动后它在每轮结束时自动发送续跑消息，并在到点后停止开启新轮；还可手动停止、查看剩余时间，并在接近截止时切换为收尾提示。它适合需要让会话持续处理任务一段时间的用户。守夜状态保存在本机的 DSH 数据目录中，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:594","lib/index.js:543","lib/index.js:196"]}
{"unit_id":"Zci514__dsh-nightwatch#card-en","repo":"Zci514/dsh-nightwatch","commit":"0d76a4173140612ebe370ecf78d544ea64f7860d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-nightwatch adds a deadline button to the DSH web composer. It continues a session after completed turns until the chosen time, then stops opening new turns. The card shows a countdown and lets users change the deadline or stop early. State is stored locally; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:594","lib/index.js:543","lib/index.js:196"]}
